gantt
  title Release
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  excludes weekends
  todayMarker off
  section Build
    Design      :done, des, 2024-01-08, 4d
    Implement   :active, imp, after des, 8d
    Review      :crit, rev, after imp, 2d
  section Ship
    Release     :milestone, rel, after rev, 0d
    Announce    :ann, after rel, 3d
